" end="0:47.680">Printre</span> <span begin="0:47.680" end="0:48.680">gropi,</span> <span begin="0:48.680" end="0:50.180">printre</span> <span begin="0:50.180" end="0:52.680">ruine,</span></p><p begin="0:52.680" end="0:56.980" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:52.680" end="0:53.680">Singuri</span> <span begin="0:53.680" end="0:54.680">nu</span> <span begin="0:54.680" end="0:55.680">ne</span> <span begin="0:55.680" end="0:56.980">lăsa!</span></p><p begin="0:56.980" end="1:02.950" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:56.980" end="0:57.975">Doamne,</span> <span begin="0:57.975" end="0:59.965">cine</span> <span begin="0:59.965" end="1:00.960">poartă</span> <span begin="1:00.960" end="1:02.950">vina</span></p><p begin="1:02.950" end="1:08.920" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:02.950" end="1:04.940">Chinului</span> <span begin="1:04.940" end="1:08.920">nemângâiat?</span></p><p begin="1:08.920" end="1:14.890" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:08.920" end="1:09.915">Singuri</span> <span begin="1:09.915" end="1:11.905">ne-am</span> <span begin="1:11.905" end="1:12.403">străpuns</span> <span begin="1:12.403" end="1:12.900">de</span> <span begin="1:12.900" end="1:14.890">moarte</span></p><p begin="1:14.890" end="1:20.860" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:14.890" end="1:15.388">Când</span> <span begin="1:15.388" end="1:15.885">pe</span> <span begin="1:15.885" end="1:17.875">Tine</span> <span begin="1:17.875" end="1:18.373">Te-am</span> <span begin="1:18.373" end="1:20.860">lăsat.</span></p><p begin="1:20.860" end="1:26.830" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:20.860" end="1:21.358">Am</span> <span begin="1:21.358" end="1:22.850">sorbit</span> <span begin="1:22.850" end="1:26.830">fărădelegea,</span></p><p begin="1:26.830" end="1:32.800" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:26.830" end="1:27.328">Tot</span> <span begin="1:27.328" end="1:29.815">paharul</span> <span begin="1:29.815" end="1:30.313">ei</span> <span begin="1:30.313" end="1:32.800">amar,</span></p><p begin="1:32.800" end="1:38.770" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:32.800" end="1:33.298">Dar</span> <span begin="1:33.298" end="1:33.795">prin</span> <span begin="1:33.795" end="1:35.785">valuri</span> <span begin="1:35.785" end="1:38.770">de-ntuneric</span></p><p begin="1:38.770" end="1:45.460" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:38.770" end="1:40.760">Căutăm</span> <span begin="1:40.760" end="1:41.755">al</span> <span begin="1:41.755" end="1:42.750">Tău</span> <span begin="1:42.750" end="1:45.460">har.</span></p><p begin="1:45.460" end="1:51.490" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:45.460" end="1:45.962">Te</span> <span begin="1:45.962" end="1:47.470">simțim</span> <span begin="1:47.470" end="1:49.480">alături,</span> <span begin="1:49.480" end="1:51.490">Doamne,</span></p><p begin="1:51.490" end="1:57.519" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:51.490" end="1:51.992">Sus</span> <span begin="1:51.992" end="1:52.495">pe</span> <span begin="1:52.495" end="1:54.505">cruce</span> <span begin="1:54.505" end="1:57.519">răstignit!</span></p><p begin="1:57.519" end="2:04.052" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:57.519" end="1:58.524">Câte</span> <span begin="1:58.524" end="2:00.534">vaiuri</span> <span begin="2:00.534" end="2:01.037">sunt</span> <span begin="2:01.037" end="2:01.539">pe</span> <span begin="2:01.539" end="2:04.052">lume,</span></p><p begin="2:04.052" end="2:09.579" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:04.052" end="2:04.554">Toate-n</span> <span begin="2:04.554" end="2:06.564">Tine</span> <span begin="2:06.564" end="2:07.066">au</span> <span begin="2:07.066" end="2:09.579">izbit...</span></p><p begin="2:09.579" end="2:15.608" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:09.579" end="2:12.594">Nu-nțelegem</span> <span begin="2:12.594" end="2:13.096">cum</span> <span begin="2:13.096" end="2:13.599">vei</span> <span begin="2:13.599" end="2:15.608">scoate</span></p><p begin="2:15.608" end="2:21.638" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:15.608" end="2:16.613">Pasul</span> <span begin="2:16.613" end="2:18.623">nostru</span> <span begin="2:18.623" end="2:19.126">din</span>