/span> <span begin="3:02.532" end="3:04.492">ramuri</span> <span begin="3:04.492" end="3:04.982">nu</span> <span begin="3:04.982" end="3:07.431">lăsa,</span></p><p begin="3:07.431" end="3:13.310" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:07.431" end="3:07.921">Și,</span> <span begin="3:07.921" end="3:08.411">în</span> <span begin="3:08.411" end="3:10.371">ziua</span> <span begin="3:10.371" end="3:13.310">răzbunării,</span></p><p begin="3:13.310" end="3:19.189" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:13.310" end="3:13.800">Să</span> <span begin="3:13.800" end="3:15.270">vedem</span> <span begin="3:15.270" end="3:17.230">slava</span> <span begin="3:17.230" end="3:19.189">Ta!</span></p></div></body></tt>